    "summary": "Each player secretly records:\n\n- units starting embarked, and in which **TRANSPORTS**\n- units starting in **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**: at most half the units in their Combat Patrol, counting any the Combat Patrol requires to start there\n- optionally, which **bodyguard** unit each **[leader](vsdata:core-ability/leader)** unit starts attached to\n- the one enhancement they use, out of the two open to them\n\nThen the players reveal these choices. Each player's Combat Patrol names their **WARLORD** model, which has the **WARLORD** keyword.",
